'''Mos Espa Market''' was a marketplace located in the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]], a [[spaceport]] on the [[desert]] [[planet]] of [[Tatooine]]. At the time of the [[Invasion of Naboo]], it was possible to buy [[gorg]]s for seven [[wupiupi]] apiece in Mos Espa Market.<ref name="AEYNTK" /> A small imitation [[Mos Espa Market (Arena)| Mos Espa Market]] could be found within the [[Mos Espa Waystation]] battlefield of the [[Grand Arena]], utilized by the [[Hunters of the Outer Rim]] on the [[planet]] [[Vespaara]].<ref name="Hunters">''[[Star Wars: Hunters]]''</ref>

